{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/s0r4lj","slideIndex":4,"text":"At the middle noise setting, the synthetic model included 78 candidate error terms. SLC kept 52 nonzero terms and set a bias bound of 0.047. PNA preprocessing took 1.25 seconds with the full model and 1.18 seconds after SLC. The estimated sampling cost changed from 2.61 to 1.90."}
