{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/hrmy7u","slideIndex":8,"text":"The local results show the algorithmic flow but are not hardware results because calibration rates are synthetic. The official assignment asks for NoiseLearnerV3 and a simulated noisy backend; official documentation says NoiseLearnerV3 does not have a local testing mode. If an IBM Quantum account and backend become available, replace the synthetic model with the output of the official noise learner. Source: https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/en/guides/migrate-to-client-side-primitives"}